    "body": "This seems like an existing bug. Maybe this happened when the link element was refactored? If we invoke the URL parser directly we'd also have to copy the document encoding over somehow. Maybe passing _environment_ always does the right thing?\r\n\r\n@noamr can you help here. Or did you not refactor this?\r\n\r\nEither way, if we fix this here this PR would no longer be editorial.",
